---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Utah Oasis Homes | Utah Custom Home Builder"
  description="Meet Utah Oasis Homes, a Utah custom home builder with more than 25 years of experience, direct project oversight, and a trusted network of skilled professionals."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <section class="section about-page">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumbs">
      <ol class="breadcrumbs-list">
        <li class="breadcrumbs-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li class="breadcrumbs-separator" aria-hidden="true">→</li>
        <li class="breadcrumbs-item breadcrumbs-current">Who We Are</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <header class="about-page-intro">
      <div class="pill-eyebrow">Who We Are</div>
      <h1>Personal Attention. Thoughtful Homes. Lasting Craftsmanship.</h1>
      <p>
        Utah Oasis Homes combines more than 25 years of construction experience with direct builder
        involvement and a trusted network of skilled professionals. The result is a home resolved for
        its owners, its property, and the demands of everyday life.
      </p>
    </header>

    <figure class="about-team-hero">
      <img
        src="/images/utah-oasis-homes-team.webp"
        alt="Troy Shaw and the Utah Oasis Homes team"
        width="1970"
        height="1094"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </figure>

    <section class="about-story" aria-labelledby="about-story-title">
      <div class="about-story-copy">
        <div class="pill-eyebrow">The Builder Behind the Work</div>
        <h2 id="about-story-title">Experience you can work with directly</h2>

        <p>
          Troy brings more than 25 years of construction experience to every Utah Oasis Homes project.
          He works directly with each client to understand the property, priorities, investment, and
          daily routines that should inform the home.
        </p>

        <p>
          That experience is reflected in a team of skilled craftspeople who understand that lasting
          quality comes from executing the details well. Troy remains involved from the first
          conversation through completion, coordinating decisions, monitoring the work, and keeping
          the homeowner connected to progress.
        </p>

        <p>
          Over the years, Troy has selected highly regarded subcontractors, architects,
          designers, engineers, and trade partners whose skill, reliability, and standards align
          with his own. Together, they bring considered design and experienced craftsmanship to
          every stage of the home—turning a shared plan into a durable, well-resolved residence.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="about-experience" aria-label="Utah Oasis Homes experience and approach">
        <div class="about-experience-primary">
          <strong>25+</strong>
          <span>Years of construction experience</span>
        </div>

        <div class="about-experience-detail">
          <span>Direct Involvement</span>
          <p>Personal guidance and oversight throughout the building experience.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-experience-detail">
          <span>Purposeful Planning</span>
          <p>Rooms, views, materials, and circulation are evaluated against how you intend to live.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="about-principles" aria-labelledby="about-principles-title">
      <div class="about-principles-heading">
        <div class="pill-eyebrow">What Guides the Work</div>
        <h2 id="about-principles-title">The standards behind every home</h2>
        <p>
          These values shape every relationship, decision, and detail from the first conversation
          through completion.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-principles-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>Listen First</h3>
          <p>Your priorities, routines, and vision shape the direction of the home from the beginning.</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Design with Purpose</h3>
          <p>Every room, view, and material contributes to how the home feels and functions.</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Build with Care</h3>
          <p>Disciplined coordination and precise execution turn good plans into lasting work.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-page-cta" aria-labelledby="about-cta-title">
      <div>
        <div class="pill-eyebrow">Start a Conversation</div>
        <h2 id="about-cta-title">Let’s talk about the home you’re imagining.</h2>
        <p>
          Share where you hope to build, what you need the home to accomplish, and which ideas are
          already taking shape.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a href="/start" class="btn btn-primary">Start Your Home</a>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
